@startuml
title Immediate Event Charging - Class B

participant "Network Function" as NF
participant "CHF/OCF - EBCF" as EBCF
participant "ABMF" as ABMF
participant "RF" as RF
participant "CHF/OCF - CDF" as CDF
participant "CGF" as CGF

NF -> EBCF : Online Charging Request
activate EBCF

EBCF -> CDF : Open CDR
CDF --> EBCF : CDR Opened

EBCF -> RF : Price request
RF -> RF : Price retrieval &\ncounter updates
RF --> EBCF : Price response
note right of CDF : The value of the\nevent is established -\nmonetary or non-\nmonetary

EBCF -> ABMF : Debit Balance
ABMF --> EBCF : Debit Balance response

EBCF --> NF : Online Charging Response
note left of NF : Service is

EBCF -> CDF : Close CDR
CDF --> EBCF : CDR Closed
note right of CGF : CDF will forward the\nCDR to the CGF for\nfurther distribution to\nthe billing domain
deactivate EBCF

@enduml
